## 🔒 Ecosystem Verification
- Zero Node.js / NPM dependencies
- Universal CLI suite: `hx-doctor`, `hx-diag`, `hx-inspect`, `hx-setup`
- Passive htmFX Spatial HUD & particle telemetry inspector (zero shader lag)
- Ambient .NET-like ecosystem self-installer & multi-browser detector
- Streaming zero-copy `.mx` parser and `.fx` HIR compiler kernel
